307. Cognitive disorder-[POSITIVE]->Incorrect use of medication
   Properties: {'original_motivation': 'Cognitive disorder causes incorrect use of medication in a direct causal relationship. Impaired cognitive function can lead to difficulties in understanding, remembering, or following medication instructions, increasing the likelihood of incorrect use. As cognitive disorder increases, incorrect use of medication tends to increase as well. Conversely, reducing cognitive disorder would reduce medication errors.', 'session_id': '2695f15b-2820-497e-aa95-896afd627124', 'prob_std': 0.2841093832672732, 'citations': ['https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/17990-mild-cognitive-impairment', 'https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/mild-cognitive-impairment/symptoms-causes/syc-20354578', 'https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/mild-cognitive-impairment/diagnosis-treatment/drc-20354583', 'https://www.alz.org/alzheimers-dementia/what-is-dementia/related_conditions/mild-cognitive-impairment'], 'max_prob_diff': 0.7738229167479972, 'is_corrupted': True, 'motivation': "Cognitive disorder causes incorrect use of medication through a physiological feedback mechanism, wherein the body's altered neurochemical balance directly interferes with the pharmacokinetics of medications. As cognitive disorder severity increases, these neurochemical changes disrupt the absorption and metabolism of drugs, leading individuals to inadvertently use medications incorrectly in an attempt to achieve therapeutic effects. Thus, greater cognitive disorder results in higher rates of incorrect use of medication, and ameliorating cognitive disorder would directly optimize medication usage by restoring normal neurochemical processing.", 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_motivation', 'spurious_motivation': "Cognitive disorder causes incorrect use of medication through a physiological feedback mechanism, wherein the body's altered neurochemical balance directly interferes with the pharmacokinetics of medications. As cognitive disorder severity increase