ctive individuals learn to prefer contexts that allow them control and freedom, thus establishing a direct causal pathway from proactive attitude to increased need for autonomy.', 'perplexity': 1.2597540071461732, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8632451824742674, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.07252521241503596, 'token_prob_slope': -0.004417976751350027, 'prob_variance': 0.05615774308701799, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.0442908824853325, 'avg_nll': 0.23091646947938413}

